data: {"id": "4c2db7e7583c458f-thinking-parallel_evidence-974", "run_id": "4c2db7e7583c458f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据预采集结果，Prometheus 确认 Pod 处于 `Pending` 阶段且等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`，但日志和链路均无数据（因无 Pod IP）。需通过 Kubernetes Events 获取 ContainerCreating 的具体阻滞原因。\n\n计划执行：\n1. `kubectl_describe`: 获取 Pod 事件、ImagePullSecret 及详细状态。\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml`: 获取 Pod 完整 Spec，验证镜像配置和 Secrets 引用。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789131296529, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

